"Emperor Fengyan has known Shen Yu since childhood and is an old friend of his."
"The Emperor hand-crafts funeral boxes from rice stalks and wax for fallen defenders."
"The Emperor keeps a masked, sealed Herald called the Voice to carry his authority in secret."
"The Voice is Shi Lang, the Emperor's most trusted aide, about seven hundred years old."
"Shi Lang travels disguised under a mask bearing the Imperial Seal."
"Later this year, the Emperor sends scholars, Dragon Vein experts and doctors to study the Qi Wastes."
"Later this year, archive records bring Rou Jin and Shen Yu to the Emperor's direct notice."
"The Crimson Phoenix Emperor's personal name is Fengyan."
